    "title": "N26 Expands Flexible Cash Fund Access to All Membership Tiers",
    "summary": "N26 today announced the expansion of its Flexible Cash Fund, making the investment product available across all N26 membership tiers.The Flexible Cash Fund forms a key part of N26’s investment suite, offering access to Money Market Funds alongside N26 Stocks & ETFs and N26 Crypto, enabling customers to diversify their portfolios directly within the N26 app.The product is designed for customers seeking potential yield opportunities with limited risk alongside simple, flexible access.Key features include:\nCompetitive, market-aligned performance: Maximize cash potential and returns with our flexible cash fund – yielding up to 2.57%* p.a. A fund is not a deposit. The yield is variable and capital is at risk.\nTier-wide promotional access: Until 1 January 2027, every membership tier across all markets will receive an introductory yield of up to 2.57%* p.a., matching the Metal tier offer with no N26 service fee applied. Afterwards standard tier-specific N26 service fees will apply.\nLow barriers to entry: Minimum investment starting from €1.\nHigh liquidity: Unlimited deposits and withdrawals available flexibly with no transaction fees or restrictions.\nDiversified exposure: Direct access to short-term, high-quality money market instruments.\nDaily valuation & monthly payout: Value accrues daily and is paid out on a monthly basis.\nThe Flexible Cash Fund is available to both new and existing N26 customers across all membership tiers in Austria, Finland, France, Germany, Ireland, Luxembourg, Netherlands, Portugal, Slovakia, and Spain with a personal N26 account.\nNoYesBanking09 Oct, 2026",
    "hasSummary": true,
    "link": "https://financialit.net/news/banking/n26-expands-flexible-cash-fund-access-all-membership-tiers",
    "source": "Financial IT",
    "tags": [
      "N26",
